join TowerGuide right [animation="Slide In Up" wait="true"]
TowerGuide: Some of the Hunter's staff have issued job requests! This is a good opportunity to explain what exactly they are.
TowerGuide: Job requests posted by the citizens of Starspire who are looking to commision work to be done within the tower. Typically, they will request some sort of resource, but some will issue bounties on certain monsters that appear within the tower.
TowerGuide: Job requests are largely optional, so don't feel pressured to accept them - but the rewards provided can be an avenue for helping you along your journey up the tower.
TowerGuide: Go ahead and accept a job request. Once you have completed it, come back to the Job Board and turn it in for the reward!
TowerGuide: More Jobs will be available as you make your way up the tower - so feel free to check back here periodically for new requests.